      "text": "Java Script\n- Branden Eich 1995\n\nBefore Js it was named\nMocha- Live Script -Java Script\n\nECMA(European Computer Manifacturing Association)\nThe Js Language is managed by ECMA\n\n1997 ECMA Script (ES1 version)\n\nMost Popular Version ES6\n\n\n\nFeatures:-\n1. Dynamic type in nature\n2. Add Functionality\n3. Scripting Language\n4. Loosely Type\n\n\nDatatypes in JS\n\nPrimitive:\n1. number\n2. string\n3. boolean\n4. null\n5. undefined\n6. bigint\n7. symbol\n\nNon Primitive\n1. Array\n2. Object\n3. Function\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Java Script\n- Branden Eich 1995\n\nBefore Js it was named\nMocha- Live Script -Java Script\n\nECMA(European Computer Manifacturing Association)\nThe Js Language is managed by ECMA\n\n1997 ECMA Script (ES1 version)\n\nMost Popular Version ES6\n\n\n\nFeatures:-\n1. Dynamic type in nature\n2. Add Functionality\n3. Scripting Language\n4. Loosely Type\n\n\nDatatypes in JS\n\nPrimitive:\n1. number\n2. string\n3. boolean\n4. null\n5. undefined\n6. bigint\n7. symbol\n\nNon Primitive\n1. Array\n2. Object\n3. Function\n\n\n\n",
